//! The Rust exe patches (`docs/notes/rust_patches.md`): the arena's block
//! `patches.code`, one crate in three layers.
//!
//! - `raw`: generated by engine_026g.py (`raw_026g.rs`) from `engine_026g.tsv`,
//!   `fields_026g.tsv` and `sites_026g.tsv`'s `holds`: the only layer that
//!   knows the game's memory. A `#[repr(transparent)]` handle per kind (a
//!   pointer, never 0) with an unsafe accessor per field of its own (a
//!   value's place, a pointer field's kind, an object inside it), every game
//!   function typed by those handles (called directly in its own convention,
//!   or through a cdecl thunk), kernel32's imports, the image's data, and
//!   what each lohook site's registers hold. A handle is made only there:
//!   from a typed field, a function's result or a site's register. Unsafe, no
//!   logic. Only `vostok` names it.
//! - [`vostok`]: the engine's meaning over `raw`'s handles (its own handles
//!   borrowing the hook's thread, enums, newtypes; the only `unsafe` blocks,
//!   each saying why the object is alive on that thread), the hook
//!   system (the generated entries and shims, `Context`, `Original`,
//!   `Flow`), and the runtime (the log, the panic handler, memcpy/memset).
//! - The patches, a module each ([`suicide_key`], [`ragdoll`]): `#![forbid(unsafe_code)]`,
//!   `vostok` alone. A patch's hooks are its `<patch>.toml`, from which
//!   link_026g.py generates the entries (`hook_entries_026g.asm`) and the
//!   shims (`hooks_026g.rs`, inside `vostok`).
//!
//! link_026g.py refuses an address or a hand-made binding outside `raw`, and
//! a patch module that names `raw` or allows `unsafe` (rust_patches.md).

#![cfg_attr(not(test), no_std)]
// memcpy/memset are weak so the arena keeps one when a C patch (gcc emits
// its own) is linked beside this crate (rust_patches.md, vostok::rt).
#![cfg_attr(not(test), feature(linkage))]
// `core::f32::math::sqrt` (sqrtss) for the texel factor patch 137 computes as the game does.
#![feature(core_float_math)]

#[cfg(test)]
extern crate std;

mod raw {
    include!("../../../raw_026g.rs");
}

